    "Choose Connect a Server and enter the address supplied by your cinema’s owner. The owner approves the code in the browser. Contact the owner for help with a missing title, a preparation failure or an expired connection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-AU": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose Connect a Server and enter the address supplied by your cinema’s owner. The owner approves the code in the browser. Contact the owner for help with a missing title, a preparation failure or an expired connection."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Connect to RAVĀN to get a code for the website. Copy the code, open the website and approve the device in Your cinema. Select Reading Room to read books on this device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-AU": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose Connect to RAVĀN to get a code for the website. Copy the code, open the website and approve the device in Your cinema. Select Reading Room to read books on this device."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Locate file on its screening card if access changes. Select the original file to keep its saved position and watchlist choice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-AU": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose Locate file on its screening card if access changes. Select the original file to keep its saved position and watchlist choice."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Open a Film in Files, then select a video. An H.264 MP4 with AAC audio is a good choice. To watch offline, download the film to your device in Files first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en-AU": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose Open a Film in Files, then select a video. An H.264 MP4 with AAC audio is a good choice. To watch offline, download the film to your device in Files first."
